IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- P1-annex-iii: Annex III of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744),
-- "High-risk AI systems referred to in Article 6(2)": eight areas, thirty-three points. Annex III is the same in the text as enacted and as amended
-- (the Omnibus did not touch it), so no function takes a date, and it is not gated by Article 113 (fork F-annex-gate): the Article 6 function that uses
-- it is. A function answers whether the facts of an AI system make it one that a point lists. Every function returns a BOOLEAN.
-- How to read FALSE. The Annex's chapeau says: "High-risk AI systems pursuant to Article 6(2) are the AI systems listed in any of the following areas".
-- Article 6(2) hands the class "AI systems referred to in Annex III" to this list, so a system that no point lists is outside it: the text's own no
-- (ruling of 2026-11-05 (a); fork F-annex-iii-closed). "Intended to be used" is the provider's intended purpose (Article 3(12)); a person affected by
-- the system states how it is used on them, as a proxy (the person seat says so).
-- Borrowed terms are inputs named for their source: the definitions of Article 3 (remote biometric identification system, emotion recognition, safety
-- component, law enforcement authority, ...) are BOOLEAN inputs here, and the seat layer works them out from their facts by calling the keel's functions; "profiling as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680" is a fact the caller states.
-- Areas 1, 6 and 7 begin "in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law": the area functions take that fact; where the use is
-- not permitted the area does not list the system (the text limits its own list: "in so far as"; fork F-annex-iii-so-far-as).

§ `Annex III, the chapeau: the AI systems referred to in Article 6(2)`

-- src:1719 | ANNEX III
-- src:1720 | High-risk AI systems referred to in Article 6(2)
-- src:1721 | High-risk AI systems pursuant to Article 6(2) are the AI systems listed in any of the following areas:
@ref Annex III, the chapeau (src:1719-1721)
GIVEN `the AI system is listed in point 1 (biometrics)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 2 (critical infrastructure)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 3 (education and vocational training)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 4 (employment, workers' management and access to self-employment)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 5 (essential private and public services and benefits)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 6 (law enforcement)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 7 (migration, asylum and border control management)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 8 (administration of justice and democratic processes)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III the AI system is referred to in one of the areas` MEANS
       `the AI system is listed in point 1 (biometrics)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 2 (critical infrastructure)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 3 (education and vocational training)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 4 (employment, workers' management and access to self-employment)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 5 (essential private and public services and benefits)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 6 (law enforcement)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 7 (migration, asylum and border control management)`
    OR `the AI system is listed in point 8 (administration of justice and democratic processes)`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "are the AI systems listed in any of the following areas" (a system no area lists is not referred to)

§ `Annex III point 1: Biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law`

-- src:1723 | (a) remote biometric identification systems.
-- src:1724 | This shall not include AI systems intended to be used for biometric verification the sole purpose of which is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be;
@ref Annex III point 1(a) (src:1723-1724)
GIVEN `the AI system is a remote biometric identification system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric verification` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the sole purpose of the biometric verification is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 1(a) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is a remote biometric identification system`
    AND (NOT (`the AI system is intended to be used for biometric verification` AND `the sole purpose of the biometric verification is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be`))
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This shall not include AI systems intended to be used for biometric verification the sole purpose of which is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be"

-- src:1725 | (b) AI systems intended to be used for biometric categorisation, according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics;
@ref Annex III point 1(b) (src:1725)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric categorisation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the categorisation is according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 1(b) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric categorisation`
    AND `the categorisation is according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used for biometric categorisation, according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics"

-- src:1726 | (c) AI systems intended to be used for emotion recognition.
@ref Annex III point 1(c) (src:1726)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for emotion recognition` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 1(c) the AI system is listed` MEANS
    `the AI system is intended to be used for emotion recognition`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used for emotion recognition"

-- src:1722 | 1. Biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law:
@ref Annex III point 1, the chapeau of the area (src:1722)
GIVEN `the AI system is listed in point 1(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 1(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 1(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 1 the AI system is listed in the area` MEANS
        `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law`
    AND (`the AI system is listed in point 1(a)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 1(b)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 1(c)`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law" (a use that is not permitted is not listed)

§ `Annex III point 2: Critical infrastructure`

-- src:1727 | 2. Critical infrastructure: AI systems intended to be used as safety components in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure, road traffic, or in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity.
@ref Annex III point 2 (src:1727)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the safety component is in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the safety component is in the management and operation of road traffic` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the safety component is in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 2 the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component`
    AND (   `the safety component is in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure`
         OR `the safety component is in the management and operation of road traffic`
         OR `the safety component is in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used as safety components in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure, road traffic, or in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity"

§ `Annex III point 3: Education and vocational training`

-- src:1729 | (a) AI systems intended to be used to determine access or admission or to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels;
@ref Annex III point 3(a) (src:1729)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used to determine access or admission to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 3(a) the AI system is listed` MEANS
       `the AI system is intended to be used to determine access or admission to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`
    OR `the AI system is intended to be used to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used to determine access or admission or to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels"

-- src:1730 | (b) AI systems intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes, including when those outcomes are used to steer the learning process of natural persons in educational and vocational training institutions at all levels;
@ref Annex III point 3(b) (src:1730)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 3(b) the AI system is listed` MEANS
    `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes`
    -- "including when those outcomes are used to steer the learning process" says what the point includes; it adds no element.
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes, including when those outcomes are used to steer the learning process of natural persons in educational and vocational training institutions at all levels"

-- src:1731 | (c) AI systems intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access, in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels;
@ref Annex III point 3(c) (src:1731)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the assessment is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 3(c) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access`
    AND `the assessment is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access, in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels"

-- src:1732 | (d) AI systems intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels.
@ref Annex III point 3(d) (src:1732)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the monitoring is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 3(d) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests`
    AND `the monitoring is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels"

-- src:1728 | 3. Education and vocational training:
@ref Annex III point 3, the area (src:1728)
GIVEN `the AI system is listed in point 3(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 3(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 3(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 3(d)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 3 the AI system is listed in the area` MEANS
    `the AI system is listed in point 3(a)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 3(b)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 3(c)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 3(d)`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Education and vocational training:" (the list of the area, handed to it by the chapeau)

§ `Annex III point 4: Employment, workers' management and access to self-employment`

-- src:1734 | (a) AI systems intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons, in particular to place targeted job advertisements, to analyse and filter job applications, and to evaluate candidates;
@ref Annex III point 4(a) (src:1734)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 4(a) the AI system is listed` MEANS
    `the AI system is intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons`
    -- "in particular to place targeted job advertisements, to analyse and filter job applications, and to evaluate candidates" says what the point includes; it adds no element and closes nothing.
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons, in particular to place targeted job advertisements, to analyse and filter job applications, and to evaluate candidates"

-- src:1735 | (b) AI systems intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships, to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics or to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships.
@ref Annex III point 4(b) (src:1735)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 4(b) the AI system is listed` MEANS
       `the AI system is intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships`
    OR `the AI system is intended to be used to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics`
    OR `the AI system is intended to be used to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships, to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics or to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships"

-- src:1733 | 4. Employment, workers’ management and access to self-employment:
@ref Annex III point 4, the area (src:1733)
GIVEN `the AI system is listed in point 4(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 4(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 4 the AI system is listed in the area` MEANS
    `the AI system is listed in point 4(a)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 4(b)`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Employment, workers' management and access to self-employment:" (the list of the area, handed to it by the chapeau)

§ `Annex III point 5: Access to and enjoyment of essential private services and essential public services and benefits`

-- src:1737 | (a) AI systems intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services, as well as to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services;
@ref Annex III point 5(a) (src:1737)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 5(a) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities`
    AND (   `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services`
         OR `the AI system is intended to be used to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services, as well as to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services"

-- src:1738 | (b) AI systems intended to be used to evaluate the creditworthiness of natural persons or establish their credit score, with the exception of AI systems used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud;
@ref Annex III point 5(b) (src:1738)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the creditworthiness of natural persons or establish their credit score` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 5(b) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the creditworthiness of natural persons or establish their credit score`
    AND (NOT `the AI system is used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "with the exception of AI systems used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud"

-- src:1739 | (c) AI systems intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons in the case of life and health insurance;
@ref Annex III point 5(c) (src:1739)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the risk assessment and pricing is in the case of life and health insurance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 5(c) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons`
    AND `the risk assessment and pricing is in the case of life and health insurance`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons in the case of life and health insurance"

-- src:1740 | (d) AI systems intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons or to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services, including by police, firefighters and medical aid, as well as of emergency healthcare patient triage systems.
@ref Annex III point 5(d) (src:1740)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is an emergency healthcare patient triage system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 5(d) the AI system is listed` MEANS
       `the AI system is intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons`
    OR `the AI system is intended to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services`
    OR `the AI system is an emergency healthcare patient triage system`
    -- "including by police, firefighters and medical aid" says what the services include; it adds no element.
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons or to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services, including by police, firefighters and medical aid, as well as of emergency healthcare patient triage systems"

-- src:1736 | 5. Access to and enjoyment of essential private services and essential public services and benefits:
@ref Annex III point 5, the area (src:1736)
GIVEN `the AI system is listed in point 5(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 5(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 5(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 5(d)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 5 the AI system is listed in the area` MEANS
    `the AI system is listed in point 5(a)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 5(b)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 5(c)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 5(d)`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Access to and enjoyment of essential private services and essential public services and benefits:" (the list of the area, handed to it by the chapeau)

§ `Annex III point 6: Law enforcement, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law`

-- Every point of this area names the same users: law enforcement authorities (by or on behalf of them) or Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies
-- (in support of law enforcement authorities, in some points also on their behalf). The two user facts are asked in each point, as the text repeats them.

-- src:1742 | (a) AI systems intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities, or by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities or on their behalf to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences;
@ref Annex III point 6(a) (src:1742)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities or on their behalf` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 6(a) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        (   `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities`
         OR `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities or on their behalf`)
    AND `the AI system is intended to be used to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities, or by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities or on their behalf to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences"

-- src:1743 | (b) AI systems intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities or by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities as polygraphs or similar tools;
@ref Annex III point 6(b) (src:1743)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 6(b) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        (   `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities`
         OR `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities`)
    AND `the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities or by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities as polygraphs or similar tools"

-- src:1744 | (c) AI systems intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities, or by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies, in support of law enforcement authorities to evaluate the reliability of evidence in the course of the investigation or prosecution of criminal offences;
@ref Annex III point 6(c) (src:1744)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the reliability of evidence in the course of the investigation or prosecution of criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 6(c) the AI system is listed` MEANS
