             AND `the assessment is not solely on the basis of the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680`)
         OR `the AI system is intended to be used to assess personality traits and characteristics or past criminal behaviour of natural persons or groups`)
