-- src:1741 | 6. Law enforcement, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law:
@ref Annex III point 6, the chapeau of the area (src:1741)
GIVEN `the AI system is listed in point 6(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 6(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 6(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 6(d)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is listed in point 6(e)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 6 the AI system is listed in the area` MEANS
        `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law`
    AND (   `the AI system is listed in point 6(a)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 6(b)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 6(c)`
         OR `the AI system is listed in point 6(d)` OR `the AI system is listed in point 6(e)`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Law enforcement, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law:" (a use that is not permitted is not listed)

