§ `Annex III point 8: Administration of justice and democratic processes`

-- src:1753 | (a) AI systems intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts, or to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution;
@ref Annex III point 8(a) (src:1753)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system is intended to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 8(a) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        (    `the AI system is intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf`
         AND `the AI system is intended to be used to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts`)
    OR `the AI system is intended to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "AI systems intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts, or to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution"

-- src:1754 | (b) AI systems intended to be used for influencing the outcome of an election or referendum or the voting behaviour of natural persons in the exercise of their vote in elections or referenda. This does not include AI systems to the output of which natural persons are not directly exposed, such as tools used to organise, optimise or structure political campaigns from an administrative or logistical point of view.
@ref Annex III point 8(b) (src:1754)
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for influencing the outcome of an election or referendum or the voting behaviour of natural persons in the exercise of their vote in elections or referenda` IS A BOOLEAN
      `natural persons are not directly exposed to the output of the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex III point 8(b) the AI system is listed` MEANS
        `the AI system is intended to be used for influencing the outcome of an election or referendum or the voting behaviour of natural persons in the exercise of their vote in elections or referenda`
    AND (NOT `natural persons are not directly exposed to the output of the AI system`)
    -- "such as tools used to organise, optimise or structure political campaigns from an administrative or logistical point of view" is an example of the excluded systems; it adds no element.
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This does not include AI systems to the output of which natural persons are not directly exposed"

